1: //! Thread-level hardware Flush-To-Zero (FTZ) and Denormals-Are-Zero (DAZ) controls (`Design.md §4.1`).
2: //!
3: //! Subnormal floating point values in upstream FIR filter delay lines cause severe CPU latency spikes.
4: //! Setting FTZ and DAZ ensures any underflowing subnormal decays immediately to 0.0 without microcode traps.
